        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "\\# Sr. Full Stack Web Developer – Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# About the Company\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n CGS Business Solutions provides IT business solutions, staffing, and consulting services, helping IT professionals connect with consulting and full\\-time opportunities. The company specializes in IT applications, network infrastructure, information security, and engineering. CGS is an INC 5000 company and has expanded its services across markets in the United States.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# About the Role\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n CGS Business Solutions is seeking a Senior Full Stack Web Developer to build and enhance modern, scalable web applications using React, TypeScript, Next.js, and Node.js. The role involves developing front\\-end and back\\-end solutions, building API integrations, and deploying applications on AWS with connections to various backend databases.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The ideal candidate brings 7\\+ years of professional web application development experience, strong backend and API development expertise, and the ability to work effectively across Product, UX, and QA teams. The role also includes code reviews, mentoring junior developers, and contributing to development standards and best practices.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Key Responsibilities\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* Build and enhance modern web applications using React, TypeScript, Next.js, and Node.js.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Deploy applications on AWS and integrate them with various backend databases.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Design, develop, and maintain web applications using open\\-source front\\-end and back\\-end technologies, frameworks, and APIs.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Architect and implement integrations between Salesforce and external applications and services.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Develop robust backend API services using Node.js.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Ensure application performance, security, scalability, and maintainability meet enterprise standards.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Collaborate with Product, UX, QA, and other cross\\-functional teams to deliver high\\-quality features on schedule.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Participate in code reviews and contribute to development best practices and standards.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Mentor junior developers and support technical knowledge sharing.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Required Qualifications\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* 7\\+ years of professional web application development experience.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Proven experience building scalable, modern web applications using React, TypeScript, and Node.js.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience with Next.js is preferred within the core technology stack.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Strong expertise in Node.js backend development.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience designing and implementing robust API services.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Strong experience developing and integrating APIs.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience with REST and SOAP protocols.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Practical experience with RESTful and GraphQL APIs.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience with modern DevOps practices and CI/CD pipelines.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience with Git\\-based development workflows.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Strong problem\\-solving skills.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Ability to work independently and collaboratively as part of a team.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Preferred Qualifications\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* Experience with AWS or other cloud platforms for application hosting and integration.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Skills \\& Competencies\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* Full Stack Web Development\n \n\n\n\n \\* React\n \n\n\n\n \\* TypeScript\n \n\n\n\n \\* Next.js\n \n\n\n\n \\* Node.js\n \n\n\n\n \\* Backend Development\n \n\n\n\n \\* API Development\n \n\n\n\n \\* REST APIs\n \n\n\n\n \\* GraphQL\n \n\n\n\n \\* SOAP\n \n\n\n\n \\* Salesforce Integrations\n \n\n\n\n \\* AWS / Cloud Platforms\n \n\n\n\n \\* CI/CD\n \n\n\n\n \\* DevOps\n \n\n\n\n \\* Git\n \n\n\n\n \\* Web Application Architecture\n \n\n\n\n \\* Application Security\n \n\n\n\n \\* Performance Optimization\n \n\n\n\n \\* Code Reviews\n \n\n\n\n \\* Technical Mentoring\n \n\n\n\n \\* Problem Solving\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Education \\& Experience\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Experience:\\*\\* 7\\+ years of professional web application development experience.\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Education:\\*\\* Not specified in the original job description.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Work Arrangement \\& Schedule\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Location:\\*\\* Wisconsin, US\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Work Arrangement:\\*\\* Remote\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Employment Type:\\*\\* Full\\-Time\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Seniority Level:\\*\\* Mid\\-Senior Level\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Job Function:\\*\\* Information Technology\n \n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Industry:\\*\\* IT Services and IT Consulting\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Compensation\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* \\*\\*Base Salary:\\*\\* $145,000–$165,000 per year.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Actual compensation is based on skills and experience.",
